<title>USA: Chancellor sets $750 ln credit facility.</title>
<headline>Chancellor sets $750 ln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chancellor Broadcasting Co said that its subsidiary, Chancellor Radio Broadcasting, has closed a new $750 million credit facility.</p>
<p>The $750 million credit facility will be used to refinance the existing credit facility, finance certain recently announced transactions, including the acquisition of four radio stations from Viacom Inc, working capital and other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
